<title>USA: TENNIS-FIRST-ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FIRST-ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-round result at the season-ending $2 million Chase Championships tennis tournament at Madison Sqaure Garden on Monday. (prefix number denotes seeding)</p>
<p>Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat 6-Anke Huber (Germany) 7-5 6-3</p>
